Mix components, adjust pH to 6.5-7.0, and autoclave. For preparation of solid media, add 15.0 g/L agar and 0.1 g/L Na<sub>2</sub>SO<sub>4</sub> before autoclaving. After cooling, add the following solutions (filter-sterilized):  <br>
<TABLE BORDER>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> 8% NaHCO<sub>3</sub> solution                                    </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;2.5&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> ml  </TD></TR>
